# Turborepo & Workspaces

## Runtime

- Node `>=24` (root `engines`).
- `packageManager`: `pnpm@12.5.1` (use `corepack enable`).
- All apps/packages: `"type": "module"`.

## Workspace naming

- Packages: `@workspace/<name>`.
- Apps: `web`, `api`, `worker`, `mobile` (plain names in `package.json`).

## Task pipeline (`turbo.json`)

- `build` → depends on `^build`, `^db:generate`, `db:generate`. Outputs: `.next/**`, `dist/**`.
- `lint`, `typecheck` → depend on `^db:generate`, `^build`.
- `test` → depends on `^build`, `db:generate`; `cache: false`.
- `dev` → persistent, uncached.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev             # api + web + worker + mobile (Expo Metro)
pnpm mobile:android  # Expo + Android emulator/device (not under turbo dev)
pnpm build           # all apps/packages (mobile has no Turbo build script)
pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck
pnpm db:generate     # Prisma client
pnpm db:migrate      # migrate dev
pnpm db:deploy       # migrate deploy (CI/prod)
```

## Env & Turbo cache

- Env files at **repo root** (`.env`, `.env.development`, `.env.local`, `.env.production`).
- Add new `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_*`, and build-affecting vars to `turbo.json` `build.env` / `globalEnv`.
- `globalDependencies` includes lockfile and env files — keep in sync.
- Mobile public vars: see `deploy/env/mobile.env.example` (`EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL`).

## Rules

- Root `package.json` has no app runtime deps — only tooling (turbo, prettier, husky, eslint) plus workspace refs used by root scripts/lint-staged.
- Internal deps: `"@workspace/foo": "workspace:*"`.
- Never import `apps/*` from `packages/*`.
- New package: add to `pnpm-workspace.yaml` glob, `"type": "module"`, `build`/`typecheck` scripts.
